<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 389)</h2>
<p><b>Consistency pass: the app and the web page now behave — and read — the same.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Fill toggle and fill-opacity slider now restyle the <i>selected</i> mark first, matching how color and width already worked (and matching the web).</li>
<li>Replies in the Comments window get the same tinted background and "Reply…" affordance as every other surface.</li>
<li>Cheat sheet fix: zoom presets are ⌘1–⌘4 (bare digits pick the compare set); the manual's chrome-toggle and fit keys corrected to match the app.</li>
<li>Web review: the line tool arrives in the browser toolbar, the drawer is titled Playlist, the keyboard sheet documents mark selection and delete, and the connection chip explains itself on hover.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
