<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 386)</h2>
<p><b>Tracker status on burned movies, and compare walks that survive saving.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>The <code>hud_tokens</code> plugin's lines (shot status, delivery dates) now burn into exported movies too, as stacked plates under the clip name — not just frame grabs.</li>
<li>Compare A/B side marks save with the session and restore when it reopens — marked by file name, so they survive relinking and packaging.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
